{"name":"Dust Bunny","hex":"#c8b6a6","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dust bunny","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small clump of dust, fluff, hair, particles of skin, etc., that tends to accumulate indoors in areas not regularly dusted, such as under heavy furniture."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dust_bunny"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dust Bunny","blocks":[{"text":"Dust Bunny is a 2025 American independent fantasy action film written, produced, and directed by Bryan Fuller in his feature film directorial debut. It stars Mads Mikkelsen, Sophie Sloan, Sheila Atim, David Dastmalchian, and Sigourney Weaver. It follows a hit man who is approached by an eight-year-old girl to kill the \"monster\" under her bed that she claims \"ate\" her family."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/Dust_Bunny_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dust_Bunny","wikidata":"Q121572303"},{"title":"Dust","blocks":[{"text":"Dust is made of fine particles of solid matter. On Earth, it generally consists of particles in the atmosphere that come from various sources such as soil lifted by wind, volcanic eruptions, and pollution."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Dust_storm_approaching_Stratford%2C_Texas.jpg/330px-Dust_storm_approaching_Stratford%2C_Texas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dust","wikidata":"Q165632"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/ce/Dust_Bunny_film_poster.jpg/250px-Dust_Bunny_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/Dust_Bunny_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/t